{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/932335-lunars-and-crippling-injuries","id":932335,"title":"Lunars and Crippling Injuries","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-15T19:40:52-07:00","id":932335,"title":"Lunars and Crippling Injuries","content":"\u200b\u200bWhat happens when a Lunar in the form of, say, an octopus loses one of his tentacles and then returns to human form? Does he lose half an arm or leg? Nothing? Can he return to octopus form and find a full eight tentacles, or just seven? What if he becomes a spider?<br /> <br /> Well, I think I have a simple solution!<br /> <br /> If the Lunar is currently suffering from a crippling injury, and shapeshifts into a form that lacks the corresponding organ or limb ruined by that injury, the Lunar must accept wounds equal to the severity of the maiming, like the Crippling rules on Page 202, but in reverse. This way, losing tentacles as an octopus will mean something even without bogging the game down in logical puzzles or tracking limb-counts.<br /> <br /> <br /> But while we're on the subject, I'd like to see a Lunar Stamina Charm that allows a Lunar to &quot;refresh&quot; the number of times her player can choose to accept a Crippling injury in place of the full health damage. Since Lunar Exalted will probably continue to have the easiest time regenerating lost limbs and organs, this is a viable damage-mitigation strategy for them.<br /> <br /> On the reverse, I'd like to see a Stamina Charm that lets a Lunar react to an involuntary crippling injury by shapeshifting into the form of a smaller creature. Basically what Spider-Lady did when Visiting Flare (or was his name something-Nova?) cut her in half. One of her halves turned into a bird and flew away to safety.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 07-15-2016, 10:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}